# Optional. Leave unset for local dev so the app uses /api on the Vite port (5173) and the dev proxy forwards to the API.
# Set for production (e.g. Netlify) to your deployed API origin, no trailing slash.
# If you set http://localhost:5000 here, you must run the API on port 5000 (repo root: npm run dev, or npm run dev:server).
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com
